  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a large bowl, mix cassaba with hoisin sauce, sesame oil, sesame seeds, scallions, charred chili flakes, salt, sugar and cornstarch.",
    "Roll out bao dough to a thickness of 1/4 inch.",
    "Place 1/4 cup of cassaba mixture onto the center of each dough circle.",
    "Fold dough to form a half-moon shape and press edges to seal.",
